HW.add("en", {"cm.eyebrow": "Help us grow", "cm.h": "We're growing every week. Come along.", "cm.p1": "Every day Hypewise collects fresh resale prices and keeps an eye on the sneakers moving the most right now, so you can see which pairs are rising, falling or holding steady.", "cm.p2": "We're a young project, built in public on GitHub. If you like what you see, follow us on X and share it with a friend. Questions, ideas, partnerships or investment? Write to us: we answer everyone.", "cm.x": "Follow @gethypewise on X", "cm.mailbtn": "Email us", "cm.gh": "Code on GitHub", "cm.soonl": "Coming in the next 48 hours:", "cm.rd": "Reddit, for questions and discussion", "cm.ig": "Instagram", "cm.tt": "TikTok", "cm.doubt": "Doubts or questions? Write to", "card.live": "Live data", "card.fine2": "Real data from our daily tracking. Estimates only, not financial advice.", "bn.4": "Help us grow: follow us on X @gethypewise", "ft.email": "Email", "ft.xlink": "Follow us on X"});
